	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030050"},
		line=604,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After we get home from school, Akari, Hotori, and I hold an impromptu conference.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Naturally, we want to get Akari up to speed on everything that happened.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I see... You're planning to cooperate with Elsa to take down Okonogi before turning on her.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right. Our ultimate goal has always been to restore the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We aren't about to help turn the country into a democracy like the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Akari nods in agreement, snapping off another bite of the biscuit she'd been snacking on.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Still, I don't feel good about planning to stab Elsa in the back like this.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“With the current strength of the Blades, we have no other choice.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In the first place, the Republicans were the ones to open hostilities without even declaring war. We owe them absolutely no quarter.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, but still...”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Warriors have always disapproved of underhanded tactics, but this is no time for scruples.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will take full responsibility.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll take care of explaining it to the Blades as well.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Hotori crosses her arms, her mouth pursed into a narrow line.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suppose we have no choice.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"But she eventually grumbles her acquiescence.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"It's surely a tough decision to make for the head of “The Righteous House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Problem is, we still don't know what Elsa's really after.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is she trying to pull one over on the warriors, or does she really want Operation Bellflower to succeed?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We absolutely need to figure out what she's thinking.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The same goes for Empress Hisui. Is she seriously considering the future of the Empire, or is Elsa taking her for a ride?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you think she'd seriously come up with abolishing the Imperial system all on her own?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She could very well be fed up with her current role.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I'm pretty skeptical of her intentions myself, but I don't know enough to say for certain.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I had a question for you, though.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you make contact with Empress Hisui when we\nweren't around?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I forgot to mention that.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Akari tells the story of what happened to her at school today.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"It seems to have involved dropped handkerchiefs and boorish Republican boys, among a few other things.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, are you okay with cicadas?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What sort of self-respecting warrior is afraid of cicadas?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They're totally scary, aren't they? You think they're all dead, but the next moment...”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anticipate your foe's every move, and your stout heart shall know no fear.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They're still scary as heck!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ahh...”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Hotori, who'd been silent this whole time, suddenly murmurs with recognition.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Cicada bombs?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“There's no way... But still...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Hotori mutters to herself, crossing her arms once again.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's this about cicadas?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Hotori finally levels her eyes towards Akari and me.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui's true identity just might be Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You couldn't mean my stepsister, could you?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Hotori replies with a single, grave nod.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Hold up, start from the beginning.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I first had an inkling when I noticed how Empress Hisui conducted herself today.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She's definitely had a warrior's upbringing.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I noticed the exact same thing.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Warriors are expected to keep their backs as straight as their dealings.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whether walking or standing or sitting, we are to keep an upright posture at all times.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've probably never tried, but it's pretty difficult. Most people wouldn't be able to keep it up for five minutes without getting tired.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you know what you're looking for, it's super obvious.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And Empress Hisui definitely ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"only now",
{"/font"},
" started acting like a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've seen her on the television plenty of times, but she's always carried herself like a noble.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If she went out of her way to act like a warrior in front of you two, then...”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Could she have been trying to reveal her identity?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think so.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Hotori nods in agreement as well.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okay, even supposing Empress Hisui has some connection to the warriors, what does that have to do with Kanami?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Cicada bombs.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kanami's been scared of cicadas ever since she was little.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You probably don't remember, but she always used to hide behind your back.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And also...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Bellflowers?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Hotori responds with another nod.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The seal of House Tokita is an autumn bellflower emblem.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't imagine it's a coincidence that she'd bring up bellflowers back there.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But didn't you say that your entire family passed away?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Their bodies... were never found.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“*Gulp...*”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Most of the warriors were killed in the air raid that marked the beginning of the war.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"My family was no exception, according to Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"After it was razed during the war, the Republican Army occupied the Warrior District and refused to repatriate most of the bodies.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Because of that, warrior society has decided to treat all those who are yet unaccounted for as deceased.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How the heck could you have not noticed until now?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Her face is plastered year-round on every single television and newspaper.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Everything about her appearance is completely different from back then.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Kanami I knew was a plain-looking girl with a black bob cut.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Besides, who'd ever expect their own childhood friend to become the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The power of assumptions, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, I never would've guessed Natsumi's secret identity, so maybe that's just how it goes.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But... the more I think about it, the more certain I am that\nit's really her.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My own sister, of all people...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"As this thought spins around in my head, it stirs up a whirlwind of turmoil.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The family I'd thought was deceased might've just returned from the dead.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"And yet, I feel absolutely no joy at this prospect.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"...How could my own sister commit the mortal sin of impersonating the Empress?",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I don't know how it is now, but before the war, there was a clearly-defined crime of lese majesty.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Insulting anyone of the Imperial Family was punishable by imprisonment.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Any conspiracy to bring harm upon them would have certainly merited the death penalty.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"It goes without saying that even greater loyalty to the Imperial Family is expected of those in warrior society.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"In light of that, pretending to be a false Empress is a sin so grave that the death penalty would be a mercy...",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"My sister received a warrior's upbringing, so she should be well aware of all this.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"I'm sure she must have had compelling reasons for impersonating the Empress, but even so, hers is too grave a sin to ever be absolved.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Before anything else, we have to find out the real truth.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It all starts with that.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Hotori nods gravely.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Two adumbral figures sit in a pitch-black room.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Reclining upon the windowsill, the man peers out at the nighttime scenery.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“You seem to be in rather ill humor.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“That I am.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“I feel like he hasn't been making any progress at all lately.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“I need him to remember who his true self really is.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“If not, I'll never be able to have my fun.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“I don't quite follow, myself.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Is amusement really that important?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“But of course. What else could matter more?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Take the experience of eating, for example.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“It's nothing more than stuffing dead carcasses into your mouth for the purpose of nourishment. But what becomes of the act if you think of it that way?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Reduced to a dull and vulgar exercise, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Perhaps you have a point.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Even if you procure the finest ingredients, unless you take meticulous care in their preparation, it all goes to waste.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“The most skillful of preparations, the finest cooking techniques, and the most sublime seasonings. Only then is it worthy of being served.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Certainly, the table setting and the ambience must be impeccable as well.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Only a meal presented at the perfect place, at the perfect time can become anything more.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“By being particular about every last detail, a simple 'meal' is elevated into an 'experience.'”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Get it now?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The woman nods sagely.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“And you're saying it is the same when it comes to killing?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Without the most skillful actors, the finest conditions, and the most sublime of stages, it wouldn't be worthy of my palate.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“I could hardly get excited facing him as he is now, could I?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Besides, I'm not at my best yet, either.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Speaking of setting the stage, I'm going to need you to put in some good work.”",
