			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Earlier, that girl gave you a call, didn't she? What was she after?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“It was about returning those captured spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“How self-absorbed can she get? It's only because I told her where to look that she got her hands on them in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Hahaha... Well? Did you give them back?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“I held on to a few and returned the rest.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Though it certainly grates on my nerves that Republicans dare to treat spellblades as mere tools.”",
