		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Well, I suppose I don't quite understand their value myself.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. General Warren has been pestering me about when that new weapon will be completed.”",
